  "exe": "allocation-sidecar",
  "issue": "A money library's allocation routine `Allocation.allocate` splits an amount in cents among parties in proportion to whole-number ratios. Leftover cents go to the first parties in the list whatever their ratio, so a party with ratio zero can be paid: allocating 5 cents with ratios [0, 7, 3] gives [1, 3, 1] instead of [0, 4, 1]. This is `Money::allocate` of moneyphp/money 3.0.9, reported in https://github.com/moneyphp/money/issues/436.",
